  "description": "<p><b>WHO WE ARE:</b></p>\r\n<p>Crack Salsa started as a family recipe that was modified by the Founder of Crack Salsa. She experimented with it and started taking them to events and gatherings. People who were enjoying the salsa said it was is so addicting, &ldquo;you should just call it Crack&rdquo;, and in 2015 that is where the name was created.. CRACK SALSA.</p>\r\n<p><b>WHAT WE MAKE:</b></p>\r\n<p>We make fresh salsa in 3 flavors for our local farmers markets, but for those who aren&rsquo;t local and want our addicting salsa can order some seasoning packets online, shipped anywhere, and make it right at home. Our flavors of salsa are ORIGINAL, HOT, and SMOKY.</p>\r\n<p>Not only are our salsa packets great to make salsa, you can also season foods with them. SMOKY being the most popular. They can follow us @cracksalsa as we expand our recipe catalog for our seasoning packets.</p>\r\n<p><b>HOW TO MAKE IT:</b></p>\r\n<p>Our product is simple to make: 1. Add the ingredients listed on the packet into a blender plus the packet. 2. Pulse 4-5 times and Enjoy. There is even a QR code on the packet that shows you a 60 second video on how to do it for the visual leaners. You can also customize your ingredients... i.e. no cilantro or add an onion, or step up the heat with serrano peppers. It&rsquo;s our seasoning blend that&rsquo;s the addicting stuff!!</p>\r\n<p><b>WHERE TO ORDER:</b></p>\r\n<p>Using your link, they can order online and with our exclusive discount code GETYOURFIX, they can get free shipping on orders of 3 items or more!!!!</p>\r\n<p>We would to work with you and offer your own link for 15% of sales directed to our website though your personal link.</p>\r\n<p>All the best,</p>\r\n<p>Crack Salsa!</p>",
